{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24098","headline":"池上作 · 白居易","name":"池上作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西溪风生竹森森，南潭萍开水沈沈。\n丛翠万竿湘岸色，空碧一泊松江心。\n浦派萦回误远近，桥岛向背迷窥临。\n澄澜方丈若万顷，倒影咫尺如千寻。\n泛然独游邈然坐，坐念行心思古今。\n菟裘不闻有泉沼，西河亦恐无云林。\n岂如白翁退老地，树高竹密池塘深。\n华亭双鹤白矫矫，太湖四石青岑岑。\n眼前尽日更无客，膝上此时唯有琴。\n洛阳冠盖自相索，谁肯来此同抽簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24098.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24098","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}